<title>JAPAN: SMC - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>SMC - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 66.01		vs	   62.52</p>
<p> Operating	   13.95		vs	   10.70</p>
<p> Current	     13.42		vs	   11.77</p>
<p> Net		    7.01		vs	    5.75</p>
