<p> Shares	     61 million	  vs	  61 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.25 yen	  vs	    6.25 yen</p>
<p> -Special div	 4.75 yen	  vs		 -</p>
<p>NOTE - SMC Corp is a major pneumatic equipment maker.</p>
